Android's cRCompletion::AI (00060c0c) reveals Continue when the tally becomes
a summary and accepts it only during live play. Replay clicks dismiss the
replay through cRSubGame::AI instead. Resuming the port's pause menu restores
the prompt only if the summary was already open. The flying parcels end four units
along the camera's forward axis.

